<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Privacy Policy — Bluzen</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <script>
    tailwind = { config: { theme: { extend: { colors: { bluzen: '#64DED4' } } } } };
  </script>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Montserrat', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: #05070a;
      color: #e6f0f2;
    }
    .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen">

  <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 bg-black/70 backdrop-blur border-b border-white/10">
    <div class="container flex items-center justify-between h-16">
      <a href="index.html" class="flex items-center gap-2 group">
        <img src="assets/logo.svg" alt="Bluzen logo" class="h-8 w-8 rounded-xl border border-bluzen/60 bg-bluzen/10">
        <span class="font-semibold tracking-wide text-bluzen group-hover:opacity-80">Bluzen</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container py-12 md:py-16 text-sm md:text-base space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-white/80">
      Bluzen is an online mental health service based in Ireland. We collect basic contact details and information you choose to share
      in forms, emails, and sessions so we can run the service and support you properly.
    </p>
    <p class="text-white/80">
      We do not sell your data. Your information is stored securely and only accessed by Bluzen for legitimate reasons related to your
      sessions, resources, and bookings.
    </p>
    <p class="text-white/80">
      You can request a copy or deletion of your data at any time, apart from records we may need to keep for legal, financial,
      or safety reasons.
    </p>
    <p class="text-white/80">
      This page will be updated as Bluzen grows. For questions about your data, contact
      <a href="mailto:info@bluzenfocus.com" class="text-bluzen hover:underline">info@bluzenfocus.com</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="text-xs text-white/50">
      This is a short, plain-language version for early stages of the service and does not replace formal legal advice.
    </p>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="container py-6 text-xs text-white/60 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between gap-2">
      <span>© <span id="year"></span> Bluzen.</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
